## Regional revenue

A million bytes of document is the size at which a naive parser starts to feel
slow: it is roughly a book, or a year of dashboards in one file. The committed
copy holds one section and the harness repeats it.

```mdv bar
title: Revenue by region
x: month
y: revenue
series: region
height: 320
---
